Quad4 smart fork of Forgejo
===========================

Remotes
  upstream  https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo.git  (fetch only, push disabled)
  origin    git@github.com:Quad4-Software/forge.git

Branches
  forgejo   tracks upstream/forgejo (clean Forgejo tip, do not commit here)
  master    Quad4 customizations (default)

Sync upstream
  git checkout master
  contrib/quad4/sync-upstream.sh
  or wait for .github/workflows/sync-upstream.yml weekly PR

Branding
  Default theme: quad4-dark
  Theme source: web_src/css/themes/theme-quad4-dark.css
  Logo master: contrib/quad4/brand/logo-transparent.png
  Rebuild: contrib/quad4/rebuild-brand.sh

DevOps platform features
  ALTCHA captcha (embedded in Forge): CAPTCHA_TYPE=altcha
  Docs: https://altcha.org/docs/ https://altcha.org/docs/integration/quick-start/
  Optional external Sentry/GlitchTip DSN via [sentry] (not shipped in compose)

Compose
  docker-compose.yml           hardened stack: RavenGuard edge -> forge + postgres + Valkey
  docker-compose.coolify.yml   Coolify: SERVICE_URL_* only on ravenguard:8080
  deploy/ravenguard/           ravenguard.toml (local edge), ravenguard.coolify.toml (behind Coolify)
  .env.example                 copy to .env
  Valkey: cache/session/queue via redis://valkey:6379 (Redis-protocol compatible)
  Hardening: no-new-privileges, cap_drop ALL (postgres gets minimal cap_add), healthchecks
  RavenGuard: https://github.com/Quad4-Software/ravenguard (standalone edge, not hub proxy mode)
  Coolify: assign domain to ravenguard only. Forge ROOT_URL reuses SERVICE_URL_RAVENGUARD_8080.

DevOps companions (optional next)
  Prefer behind RavenGuard or private network. Catalog: https://selfh.st/apps/
  CI: Forgejo Actions runner, or Woodpecker CI
  Registry: Zot (light OCI) or Harbor (full featured)
  Objects/LFS: Garage or SeaweedFS (S3-compatible; avoid unmaintained MinIO)
  Secrets: OpenBao or Infisical
  Auth: Authentik or Keycloak (OIDC into Forge)
  Observability: Prometheus + Grafana (Forge metrics already optional)
  Deps: Renovate bot against the forge
  Status: Uptime Kuma
  See also sovereign CI notes: Forgejo + Woodpecker + Zot

Images
  Dockerfile / Dockerfile.rootless  OCI labels (title, source, revision, created, base)
  GHCR ghcr.io/quad4-software/forge:dev|latest
       ghcr.io/quad4-software/forge-rootless:dev|latest

License
  Forgejo is GPLv3+. Distributed changes must stay GPLv3+ compatible.